      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "champ_0250_ground_03",
      "hash64": "89A40F74A5D9B3AC",
      "text": "我來替他主持吧。\\n冠軍測驗的第二輪測驗，\\r\\n技能測驗的結果是……[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
